WEBVTT

00:02.544 --> 00:05.004
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.088 --> 00:06.673
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.756 --> 00:08.425
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.508 --> 00:11.511
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.594 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.724
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.807 --> 00:17.517
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.600 --> 00:19.352
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.648
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.732 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.693
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.776 --> 00:28.236
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.319 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.614
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.698 --> 00:33.616
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.700 --> 00:37.162
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:00.894 --> 01:02.896
Breaker, breaker,
outer perimeter
looks clear, over.
断路器、断路器、
外周长
看起来很清楚，结束。

01:02.979 --> 01:06.816
Uh, Robert, Robert,
uh, Ronald, Ronald.
呃，罗伯特，罗伯特，
呃，罗纳德，罗纳德。

01:07.776 --> 01:08.902
Ryan.
瑞安.

01:08.985 --> 01:10.695
Are you sure you're not trying
to say Roger?
你确定你不尝试吗
说罗杰？

01:10.779 --> 01:12.280
Patrick: Oh, wait,
I got it, I got it.
帕特里克：哦，等等，
我明白了，我明白了。

01:12.363 --> 01:14.157
Ringo.
林戈。

01:16.242 --> 01:19.204
Patrick, we have visual contact.
帕特里克，我们有视觉接触。

01:19.287 --> 01:22.707
Now taking evasive action.
现在采取回避行动。

01:22.791 --> 01:25.919
Subject still
in close proximity, over.
主题依然
近在咫尺，结束。

01:26.002 --> 01:27.045
Hello?
你好？

01:27.128 --> 01:28.463
Please reply.
请回复。

01:28.546 --> 01:30.089
I wonder if I could order pizza
with this thing.
我想知道我是否可以订披萨
有了这个东西。

01:30.173 --> 01:31.299
Please.
请。

01:31.382 --> 01:32.425
Contact imminent, Patrick.
即将联系，帕特里克。

01:32.509 --> 01:33.968
Respond now, please.
请立即回复。

01:34.052 --> 01:35.762
Please.
请。

01:35.845 --> 01:37.847
SpongeBob, you're gonna need
to speak up.
海绵宝宝，你需要
大声说出来。

01:37.931 --> 01:40.266
My eardrums aren't what
they used to be.
我的耳膜不是这样的
他们曾经是。

01:40.350 --> 01:42.435
I can't speak up, Patrick.
我不能说话，帕特里克。

01:42.519 --> 01:45.855
There's a jellyfish over here,
and I'm worried it might
sting me if I make any loud...
这里有一只水母，
我担心它可能
如果我发出很大声就蜇我...

01:47.357 --> 01:48.233
...noises.
...噪音。

01:48.316 --> 01:49.275
Oops.
哎呀。

01:53.196 --> 01:54.948
Is he still after us, Patrick?
他还在追我们吗，帕特里克？

01:55.031 --> 01:56.282
I don't know, buddy.
我不知道，伙计。

01:56.366 --> 01:57.492
Should we turn around and check?
我们应该回头检查一下吗？

01:57.575 --> 01:59.536
Ok.
好的。

02:02.747 --> 02:05.291
Ooh, I think I landed
on my pain center.
哦，我想我落地了
在我的疼痛中心。

02:05.375 --> 02:07.043
I think I landed on a rock.
我想我落在了一块岩石上。

02:10.713 --> 02:12.257
Patrick, look.
帕特里克，看。

02:12.340 --> 02:14.050
There's a weird thing sticking
out of the ground right there.
有一个奇怪的东西粘在上面
从那里的地面上出来。

02:14.133 --> 02:16.511
That's just Squidward
sunbathing again.
这只是章鱼哥
再次晒日光浴。

02:18.388 --> 02:19.806
No, not that, Patrick.
不，不是那样，帕特里克。

02:19.889 --> 02:20.974
This.
这。

02:21.057 --> 02:22.100
What is it?
它是什么？

02:22.183 --> 02:23.476
I don't know.
我不知道。

02:23.560 --> 02:25.436
I think there's something
buried underneath it
我认为有一些东西
埋在它下面

02:25.520 --> 02:26.813
and I'm gonna
go get some shovels
so we can dig it up.
我会
去拿一些铲子
这样我们就可以把它挖出来。

02:28.940 --> 02:29.983
We?
我们？

02:35.113 --> 02:38.324
Nothing like a little
manual labor to put some hair
on your chest, eh, Patrick?
没什么像一点点
手工劳动来放置一些头发
在你胸前，呃，帕特里克？

02:38.408 --> 02:40.869
I'll say.
我会说。

02:40.952 --> 02:43.496
Plus, look at what
we unearthed: a U.F.O.
另外，看看什么
我们发现了：一个U.F.O.

02:43.580 --> 02:46.082
Go on, you first.
继续吧，你先。

02:50.628 --> 02:52.922
Kind of dark, huh?
有点黑暗吧？

02:53.006 --> 02:54.716
Yeah, dark.
是的，黑暗。

02:54.799 --> 02:56.926
Well, there's got to be
a light switch
around here somewhere.
嗯，一定有
一个电灯开关
就在这附近的某个地方。

02:57.010 --> 02:58.469
Found it.
找到了。

02:58.553 --> 02:59.095
Excuse me, sir.
对不起，先生。

03:02.765 --> 03:04.350
Hey, Patrick, look.
嘿，帕特里克，看。

03:04.434 --> 03:05.685
We're moving.
我们要搬家了。

03:05.768 --> 03:06.853
And here's the steering wheel.
这是方向盘。

03:06.936 --> 03:08.313
Oh, hold it, SpongeBob.
哦，坚持住，海绵宝宝。

03:08.396 --> 03:09.439
You'd better let me drive.
你最好让我开车。

03:09.522 --> 03:10.523
Give me that wheel.
把那个轮子给我。

03:10.607 --> 03:11.566
No, let go.
不，放手吧。

03:11.649 --> 03:12.567
I want to drive.
我想开车。

03:15.862 --> 03:17.405
I don't understand, Squidward.
我不明白，章鱼哥。

03:17.488 --> 03:19.574
Where are all the customers?
所有的顾客都在哪里？

03:19.657 --> 03:23.661
I know the Krusty Krab
isn't Bikini Bottom's
most prestigious eatery
我认识蟹堡王
不是比基尼泳裤
最负盛名的餐馆

03:23.745 --> 03:26.831
but at least it's better
than that salty old Chum Bucket
across the street
但至少这样更好
比那个咸的老密友桶
街对面

03:26.915 --> 03:29.000
and that's our only competition.
这是我们唯一的竞争。

03:29.083 --> 03:31.336
Am I getting paid extra
for this conversation?
我能得到额外报酬吗
为了这次谈话？

03:31.419 --> 03:32.837
Come on, Squidward.
来吧，章鱼哥。

03:32.921 --> 03:35.548
Can't you just pretend to listen
for once in your life?
你就不能假装在听吗
你一生中就一次吗？

03:35.632 --> 03:37.300
Do it for old Mr. Krabs.
为老蟹老板做这件事吧。

03:39.177 --> 03:41.512
well, since you can't
bring any customers
into the Krusty Krab
好吧，既然你不能
带来任何客户
进入蟹堡王

03:41.596 --> 03:44.098
have you ever thought about
bringing the Krusty Krab
to the customers?
你有没有想过
带来了蟹堡王
给客户？

03:44.182 --> 03:45.892
Quiet, Squidward,
I'm brainstorming.
安静，章鱼哥，
我正在集思广益。

03:45.975 --> 03:47.393
Ooh, ooh.
哦哦。

03:47.477 --> 03:50.730
What if,
instead of bringing customers
to the Krusty Krab
如果，
而不是带来顾客
到蟹堡王

03:50.813 --> 03:54.067
we could bring the Krusty Krab
to the customers?
我们可以带Krusty Krab
给客户？

03:54.150 --> 03:57.779
♪ La-la, la-la-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

03:57.862 --> 03:59.322
Why, yes, of course.
为什么，是的，当然。

03:59.405 --> 04:00.323
But how?
但如何呢？

04:00.406 --> 04:02.992
Can we park here?
我们可以在这里停车吗？

04:04.410 --> 04:05.703
Hey, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

04:05.787 --> 04:07.747
Look what Patrick and I found.
看看帕特里克和我发现了什么。

04:07.830 --> 04:10.416
We're gonna use it to go
on a long journey.
我们要用它去
在长途旅行中。

04:10.500 --> 04:12.251
Or even around the block.
甚至在街区附近。

04:12.335 --> 04:13.836
That's it.
就是这样。

04:13.920 --> 04:15.755
We'll take the Krusty Krab
on the road.
我们要吃蟹堡王
在路上。

04:18.591 --> 04:19.676
So long, lad.
再见，小伙子。

04:19.759 --> 04:20.760
Make me lots of money.
让我赚很多钱。

04:20.843 --> 04:22.053
Bye, Squidward.
再见，章鱼哥。

04:22.136 --> 04:23.262
Bye, Mr. Krabs.
再见，蟹老板。

04:23.346 --> 04:24.639
Bye, Squidward.
再见，章鱼哥。

04:24.722 --> 04:26.349
You said "Bye, Squidward" twice.
你说了两次“再见，章鱼哥”。

04:26.432 --> 04:28.893
I like Squidward.
我喜欢章鱼哥

04:28.977 --> 04:31.646
A traveling restaurant, eh?
一家旅行餐厅，嗯？

04:31.729 --> 04:33.898
It's not fair.
这不公平。

04:33.982 --> 04:36.359
I had that idea years ago.
我几年前就有这个想法。

04:36.442 --> 04:37.610
No matter.
不管。

04:37.694 --> 04:39.529
If Mr. Krabs
wants to play dirty
如果蟹老板
想要玩肮脏的游戏

04:39.612 --> 04:44.283
then Plankton's ready
for his turn to take his turn.
那么浮游生物就准备好了
轮到他了。

04:54.335 --> 04:55.545
Hello.
你好。

04:55.628 --> 04:56.879
Hello.
你好。

04:56.963 --> 04:59.048
Could I interest you
in a Krabby Patty?
我可以让你感兴趣吗
在蟹黄馅饼里？

04:59.132 --> 05:00.008
No thanks.
不，谢谢。

05:00.091 --> 05:01.259
Now what?
现在怎么办？

05:01.342 --> 05:03.052
I don't know, Patrick.
我不知道，帕特里克。

05:03.136 --> 05:05.221
Mr. Krabs said,
if we didn't find customers,
not to come back.
蟹老板说，
如果我们找不到客户
不回来。

05:07.140 --> 05:09.726
Are you sure you don't want
to be our first customer, sir.
你确定你不想要
成为我们的第一个客户，先生。

05:09.809 --> 05:11.519
Uh, yeah, I'm pretty sure.
呃，是的，我很确定。

05:11.602 --> 05:12.645
SpongeBob: Wait.
海绵宝宝：等等。

05:12.729 --> 05:14.230
We'll pay you.
我们会付钱给你。

05:14.313 --> 05:15.940
Hey, thanks again, guys.
嘿，再次谢谢你们。

05:16.024 --> 05:17.316
Good luck with the restaurant.
祝餐厅好运。

05:17.400 --> 05:18.484
Thank you, sir.
谢谢您，先生。

05:18.568 --> 05:20.028
Come again.
再来吧。

05:20.111 --> 05:24.115
Those nincompoops are better
salesmen than I suspected.
那些傻瓜更好
推销员比我想象的还要多。

05:25.658 --> 05:26.826
Woman: Customer approaching.
女：顾客来了。

05:26.909 --> 05:28.661
Plankton: Hello, little boy.
浮游生物：你好，小男孩。

05:28.745 --> 05:30.621
Would you like a chum burger?
您想要一个汉堡吗？

05:30.705 --> 05:34.042
Uh, does it come in raspberry?
呃，有覆盆子色吗？

05:34.125 --> 05:35.334
Uh, no.
呃，不。

05:35.418 --> 05:36.711
Blueberry?
蓝莓？

05:36.794 --> 05:37.837
No.
不。

05:37.920 --> 05:43.426
Um... raspberry?
嗯...覆盆子？

05:43.509 --> 05:45.887
Oh, come on, kid,
you asked me that already.
哦，来吧，孩子，
你已经问过我了。

05:45.970 --> 05:47.680
Now quit wasting my time.
现在别再浪费我的时间了。

05:47.764 --> 05:50.767
Hey, you can't talk
to my son that way.
嘿，你不能说话
对我儿子就是这样。

05:50.850 --> 05:52.518
Who do you think you are?
你以为你是谁？

05:52.602 --> 05:56.189
I'm Plankton, you old hag,
and your son
smells like boogers.
我是浮游生物，你这个老太婆，
和你的儿子
闻起来像鼻屎。

05:56.272 --> 05:58.107
Hey, you can't talk
to my wife that way.
嘿，你不能说话
对我妻子来说就是这样。

05:58.191 --> 05:59.859
What do you think this is?
你觉得这是什么？

05:59.942 --> 06:01.778
I think it's time for you
to lose some weight, fattie.
我想你是时候了
减肥吧，胖子。

06:01.861 --> 06:03.237
That's what it is.
就是这样。

06:03.321 --> 06:06.532
Hey, you can't talk
to my grandson like that.
嘿，你不能说话
对我的孙子就是这样。

06:06.616 --> 06:09.118
Someone ought to put you
in a mental hospital.
应该有人把你
在精神病院里。

06:09.202 --> 06:12.371
Someone should put you
in a box floating
down the river, grandma.
应该有人把你
在一个漂浮的盒子里
奶奶，顺河而下。

06:12.455 --> 06:14.373
You're probably right.
你可能是对的。

06:14.457 --> 06:16.375
You people are crazy.
你们这些人太疯狂了。

06:16.459 --> 06:17.543
I'm getting out of here.
我要离开这里。

06:17.627 --> 06:18.711
What the?
什么？

06:22.090 --> 06:24.884
No, controls malfunctioning.
不，控制装置出现故障。

06:28.888 --> 06:30.723
Hey, Patrick?
嘿，帕特里克？

06:30.807 --> 06:32.266
Yeah?
是的？

06:32.350 --> 06:34.894
Weren't you supposed to be
on kitchen duty?
你不应该是
值班厨房？

06:34.977 --> 06:37.980
Oh no, you burned
all the patties.
哦不，你烧伤了
所有的肉饼。

06:38.064 --> 06:39.816
It's hard as a rock.
它像石头一样坚硬。

06:39.899 --> 06:41.609
How're we gonna find
somebody who'll buy these?
我们要如何找到
有人会买这些吗？

06:44.028 --> 06:45.071
Hey, the rocks are all gone.
嘿嘿，石头都不见了。

06:45.154 --> 06:48.783
Aw.
噢。

06:48.866 --> 06:50.868
Folks, have I got
a deal for you.
各位，我有吗
给你一笔交易。

06:55.706 --> 06:58.751
All right, get him!
好吧，抓住他！

07:03.506 --> 07:06.717
Won't Mr. Krabs be so proud
of us when he finds out
how good we're doing?
蟹老板会不会感到如此自豪
当他发现时我们
我们做得怎么样？

07:07.677 --> 07:09.011
See any new customers, Patrick?
帕特里克，看到新顾客了吗？

07:09.095 --> 07:11.430
No, but I see a sign.
不，但我看到一个标志。

07:11.514 --> 07:15.518
It says, "Warning: ab eyes?"
它说：“警告：ab 眼睛？”

07:15.601 --> 07:17.270
Here, let me see.
在这里，让我看看。

07:17.353 --> 07:20.273
No, Patrick, that says "abyss."
不，帕特里克，那是“深渊”。

07:20.356 --> 07:22.191
Patrick: Oh, ok.
帕特里克：哦，好吧。

07:22.275 --> 07:23.943
What's an abyss, SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝，深渊是什么？

07:24.026 --> 07:25.653
An abyss is a bottomless...
深渊是无底的...

07:25.736 --> 07:29.574
...chasm!
...鸿沟！

07:29.657 --> 07:31.325
Pat, we're falling!
帕特，我们正在坠落！

07:31.409 --> 07:34.495
And now we're bathed in
an eerie red light!
现在我们沐浴在
诡异的红光！

07:35.872 --> 07:38.833
Yes, yes!
是的，是的！

07:40.793 --> 07:43.462
And now, a deafening
warning siren.
而现在，一声震耳欲聋的
警报器。

07:56.058 --> 07:57.935
Look, Patrick.
看，帕特里克。

07:58.019 --> 08:02.398
We floated back up out of
the deep, dark, depressing,
horrible abyss.
我们又浮了出来
深沉、黑暗、压抑，
可怕的深渊。

08:04.525 --> 08:07.403
Who are you calling dark
and depressing?
你说谁黑暗
和郁闷？

08:08.988 --> 08:11.532
We didn't mean it that way,
Mister Sea Monster, sir.
我们不是这个意思
海怪先生，先生。

08:11.616 --> 08:14.160
Um, what we really want
to know is, are you hungry?
嗯，我们真正想要的
要知道的是，你饿了吗？

08:14.243 --> 08:15.912
Hungry?
饥饿的？

08:15.995 --> 08:21.334
I've been asleep for 79 years,
which means my last meal
was 79 years ago.
我已经睡了79年了
这意味着我的最后一顿饭
是79年前的事了。

08:22.919 --> 08:24.420
Yes, I'm hungry.
是的，我饿了。

08:24.503 --> 08:25.254
Well then, try one of
our Krabby Patties.
那么，尝试其中之一
我们的蟹肉饼。

08:32.094 --> 08:36.933
Mm, that's the best thing
I've tasted since
that sewage spill back in '76.
嗯，这是最好的事情
我从那时起就尝过
76年的污水泄漏事件。

08:38.893 --> 08:41.187
I'll take 640 of them.
我要 640 个。

08:41.270 --> 08:43.272
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

08:43.356 --> 08:45.191
Order up.
订购吧。

08:52.615 --> 08:55.284
Now that those two
are out of the picture
现在那两个
不在画面中

08:55.368 --> 08:58.162
all the customers'll
come running to me.
所有的顾客都会
跑到我身边来。

09:04.293 --> 09:08.839
This calls
for "drasticerest" measures.
这调用
采取“最严厉”的措施。

09:10.633 --> 09:14.345
Ok, you bums,
time for the second course.
好吧，你们这些流浪汉，
第二节课的时间到了。

09:14.428 --> 09:16.264
Chum charges.
密友指控。

09:20.810 --> 09:23.187
SpongeBob, our home's
been breached.
海绵宝宝，我们家
被破坏了。

09:23.271 --> 09:24.563
You know what that means.
你知道那意味着什么。

09:24.647 --> 09:25.773
No.
不。

09:25.856 --> 09:27.233
Neither do I.
我也没有。

09:27.316 --> 09:28.359
Yes!
是的！

09:29.652 --> 09:31.279
I sunk the Krusty Krab.
我击沉了蟹堡王。

09:31.362 --> 09:33.030
I sunk the Krusty Krab.
我击沉了蟹堡王。

09:33.114 --> 09:35.241
I sunk the... Oh!
我击沉了...哦！

09:35.324 --> 09:38.494
Eh, who needs
that rustbucket anyhow?
呃，谁需要
无论如何，那个铁锈桶？

09:38.577 --> 09:40.121
Come on in there.
进来吧。

09:40.204 --> 09:43.708
I want more sandwiches.
我想要更多三明治。

09:43.791 --> 09:45.376
SpongeBob, look.
海绵宝宝，看。

09:45.459 --> 09:46.419
What is it?
它是什么？

09:46.502 --> 09:47.628
It's a liquid.
它是一种液体。

09:47.712 --> 09:49.005
SpongeBob: No, it's a solid,
it's a solid.
海绵宝宝：不，它是固体，
它是固体。

09:49.088 --> 09:52.383
It's a "lol-squid."
这是一只“哈哈鱿鱼”。

09:54.010 --> 09:57.096
All right, what's going
on in there?
好吧，发生什么事了
在那儿？

09:57.179 --> 10:00.766
Hey, that looks like
a sandwich to me.
嘿，看起来像
给我一份三明治。

10:00.850 --> 10:02.601
Not just a sandwich.
不仅仅是一个三明治。

10:02.685 --> 10:03.894
It's a "chumwich."
这是一个“chumwich”。

10:07.982 --> 10:09.108
Mm.
毫米。

10:09.191 --> 10:11.027
Now that's a sandwich.
现在这是一个三明治。

10:22.038 --> 10:24.582
Anything else
before we shell off?
还有什么吗
在我们脱壳之前？

10:24.665 --> 10:26.667
I want dessert.
我想要甜点。

10:26.751 --> 10:28.669
We don't have dessert.
我们没有甜点。

10:28.753 --> 10:31.964
Don't give another penny
to those fast food phonies.
不要再给一分钱
对于那些快餐骗子。

10:32.048 --> 10:34.759
That's right,
they stole my idea.
没错，
他们偷了我的想法。

10:34.842 --> 10:35.968
My, my, my...
我的，我的，我的……

10:41.223 --> 10:44.185
Hey, a chocolate eclair.
嘿，巧克力泡芙。

10:44.268 --> 10:45.978
Now that looks like
dessert to me.
现在看起来像
甜点给我。

10:46.062 --> 10:48.147
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

10:48.230 --> 10:50.941
You got it all wrong, see?
你全都搞错了，明白吗？

11:00.326 --> 11:02.661
Here you are, Mr. Krabs.
给你，蟹老板。

11:02.745 --> 11:04.330
Just like new again.
又像新的一样了。

11:04.413 --> 11:08.000
Now all we got to do
is keep SpongeBob away from...
现在我们要做的就是
是让海绵宝宝远离...

11:08.084 --> 11:10.294
We're back, Mr. Krabs.
我们回来了，蟹老板。

11:10.378 --> 11:11.796
Tell me all about it.
告诉我一切。

11:11.879 --> 11:13.464
Tell me, tell me, tell me,
tell me, tell me.
告诉我，告诉我，告诉我，
告诉我，告诉我。

11:13.547 --> 11:14.965
You wouldn't believe it,
Mr. Krabs.
你不会相信，
蟹老板。

11:15.049 --> 11:16.258
We had so many new customers.
我们有很多新客户。

11:16.342 --> 11:17.718
I don't care about that.
我不在乎这个。

11:17.802 --> 11:19.970
Tell me about the money.
告诉我关于钱的事。

11:20.054 --> 11:24.266
There we were, at the bottom of
a deep, dark abyss, and we had
to let go of something heavy.
我们在那里，在底部
一个又深又暗的深渊，我们有
放下沉重的东西。

11:24.850 --> 11:25.935
And paper.
还有纸。

11:26.018 --> 11:29.105
You let go of all
the money I earned as ballast?
你放下一切
我当镇流器赚的钱？

11:31.774 --> 11:34.693
But on the bright side,
we did manage to bring back
37,000 pounds
但从好的方面来看，
我们确实设法带回来了
37,000 磅

11:34.777 --> 11:37.196
of these decorative
deep sea rocks.
这些装饰性的
深海岩石。

11:56.215 --> 11:59.218
Where's your best friend
now, SpongeBob?
你最好的朋友在哪里
现在，海绵宝宝？

11:59.301 --> 12:03.806
Well, according to this t-shirt,
it says my best friend
is right here.
嗯，根据这件 T 恤，
它说我最好的朋友
就在这里。

12:05.307 --> 12:06.392
How about now?
现在怎么样？

12:06.475 --> 12:08.352
Right by my side.
就在我身边。

12:10.229 --> 12:12.773
Wow, clothing that announces
our feelings for each other.
哇，宣布的服装
我们对彼此的感情。

12:14.024 --> 12:15.359
Let's get 'em, Patrick.
让我们抓住他们，帕特里克。

12:15.443 --> 12:16.569
Can I help you, boys?
我可以帮助你们吗，孩子们？

12:16.652 --> 12:18.320
I believe you can.
我相信你可以。

12:18.404 --> 12:20.114
My best friend and I
would like to purchase...
我和我最好的朋友
想购买...

12:21.157 --> 12:22.491
Patrick, why are you crying?
帕特里克，你为什么哭？

12:22.575 --> 12:24.994
You found a new best friend.
你找到了一个新的最好的朋友。

12:25.077 --> 12:28.581
Oh, what are you...?
噢，你是什么……？

12:29.999 --> 12:31.542
Wait, no, this isn't
what it looks like.
等等，不，这不是
它看起来像什么。

12:33.002 --> 12:36.630
Patrick, look out behind you.
帕特里克，小心你身后。

12:36.714 --> 12:37.798
Excuse me,
but does this come in...
对不起，
但这是否进来...

12:37.882 --> 12:39.091
No!
不！

12:39.175 --> 12:40.551
You're not my best friend.
你不是我最好的朋友。

12:40.634 --> 12:42.219
We got to ditch these outfits.
我们必须扔掉这些衣服。

12:42.303 --> 12:43.679
They're sending out
the wrong signals.
他们正在发出
错误的信号。

12:51.312 --> 12:55.107
We need new outfits to show
our best "friendiness," Pat.
我们需要新的服装来展示
我们最好的“友谊”，帕特。

12:55.191 --> 12:56.901
You mean like those guys?
你是说像那些人一样？

12:59.069 --> 13:01.614
Yeah, just like those guys.
是的，就像那些人一样。

13:03.449 --> 13:05.826
Best friend outfits like these
really make a statement.
最好的朋友像这样的服装
真正发表声明。

13:05.910 --> 13:07.495
Look at these guys.
看看这些家伙。

13:07.578 --> 13:09.622
Whoa, I like that one.
哇哦，我喜欢那个。

13:09.705 --> 13:11.874
Hey mister, where did you
and your friends get
your matching outfits?
嘿先生，你在哪里
你的朋友会得到
你的搭配服装？

13:11.957 --> 13:14.293
Oh, no, these aren't my friends.
哦，不，这些不是我的朋友。

13:14.376 --> 13:16.378
In fact, I hate
just about everyone here
其实我讨厌
几乎这里的每个人

13:16.462 --> 13:19.507
but my love for historical
battles is so great
但我对历史的热爱
战斗是如此伟大

13:19.590 --> 13:23.260
I join these losers
every year to reenact
the Battle of Bikini Bottom.
我加入这些失败者的行列
每年都会重演
比基尼堡之战。

13:23.344 --> 13:25.554
There was a Battle
of Bikini Bottom?
有一场战斗
比基尼底部？

13:26.805 --> 13:28.974
Well, duh, SpongeBob.
嗯，呃，海绵宝宝。

13:29.058 --> 13:33.395
It's only the most significant
event in Bikini Bottom history.
这只是最重要的
比基尼泳裤历史上的事件。

13:33.479 --> 13:38.609
A long time ago, the town
was divided into two groups
很久以前，这座小镇
被分成两组

13:38.692 --> 13:43.322
those who spent all their time
washing their hands
like softies...
那些花费了全部时间的人
洗手
像软妹子一样...

13:44.698 --> 13:46.700
Clean as a whistle.
干净如口哨。

13:46.784 --> 13:49.912
Patrick: And those who had
more important things to do
with their time.
帕特里克：还有那些
更重要的事情要做
与他们的时间。

13:57.586 --> 13:59.880
Well, looks good to me.
嗯，我觉得不错。

13:59.964 --> 14:02.925
That is truly disgusting.
这实在是太恶心了。

14:03.008 --> 14:04.760
Oh yeah?
哦，是吗？

14:04.843 --> 14:08.597
You can't go around
our town touching things
with those filthy mitts.
你不能四处走动
我们的小镇触动事物
带着那些肮脏的手套。

14:09.598 --> 14:11.100
Oh yeah?
哦，是吗？

14:11.183 --> 14:12.935
Yes.
是的。

14:21.318 --> 14:23.904
Wash your hands.
洗手。

14:23.988 --> 14:25.197
Never.
绝不。

14:30.619 --> 14:34.290
And that's how we won our right
to wash as we please.
这就是我们赢得权利的方式
随心所欲地洗。

14:35.874 --> 14:37.918
That's not what happened.
事实并非如此。

14:38.002 --> 14:39.962
You don't wash
your hands, Patrick?
你不洗
你的手，帕特里克？

14:40.045 --> 14:41.797
Never have, never will.
从来没有，也永远不会。

14:41.880 --> 14:43.007
Blech.
布莱赫。

14:43.090 --> 14:45.676
Does that bother you?
这让你烦恼吗？

14:45.759 --> 14:49.346
Huh, SpongeBob?
哈，海绵宝宝？

14:49.430 --> 14:53.058
They only had
one ice cream cone.
他们只有
一个蛋卷冰淇淋。

14:53.142 --> 14:54.560
That's ok.
没关系。

14:54.643 --> 14:55.185
Thank you, friend.
谢谢你，朋友。

15:00.024 --> 15:01.609
So anyway, I said...
所以无论如何，我说...

15:01.692 --> 15:03.068
Wait.
等待。

15:03.152 --> 15:04.570
You got something
on your tongue.
你有东西
在你的舌头上。

15:04.653 --> 15:05.654
Really?
真的吗？

15:05.738 --> 15:06.488
Here, I'll get it.
在这里，我会得到它。

15:10.659 --> 15:12.077
Thank you.
谢谢。

15:12.161 --> 15:14.371
Frankly, yes, Patrick,
that does bother me.
坦率地说，是的，帕特里克，
这确实让我烦恼。

15:14.455 --> 15:16.790
Well then I guess
we can't be friends.
那么我想
我们不能成为朋友。

15:16.874 --> 15:17.833
What are you saying?
你在说什么？

15:19.168 --> 15:22.463
Do I have to
spell it out for you?
我必须吗
给你拼出来吗？

15:22.546 --> 15:26.508
You are... Um...
你是……嗯……

15:27.968 --> 15:29.094
How do you spell
"not my friend?"
你怎么拼写
“不是我的朋友吗？”

15:29.178 --> 15:30.596
Oh, come on.
哦，来吧。

15:30.679 --> 15:31.972
We can work this out.
我们可以解决这个问题。

15:32.056 --> 15:33.641
We'll start a new life.
我们将开始新的生活。

15:33.724 --> 15:36.226
Just you, me, and this can
of disinfectant spray.
只有你、我，这可以
的消毒喷雾。

15:40.606 --> 15:42.024
Come on in, Patrick.
进来吧，帕特里克。

15:42.107 --> 15:43.067
Here, let me take
your coat for you.
在这里，让我带
你的外套给你。

15:46.945 --> 15:50.282
No thank you.
不，谢谢。

15:50.366 --> 15:54.411
I happen to like
my various smells and germs.
我恰好喜欢
我的各种气味和细菌。

15:54.495 --> 15:56.538
But being clean
is so much better.
但保持干净
好多了。

15:56.622 --> 15:57.706
Well, says you.
好吧，你说。

15:57.790 --> 15:58.707
I like dirty.
我喜欢肮脏的。

15:58.791 --> 15:59.667
Clean.
干净的。

15:59.750 --> 16:00.626
Dirty.
肮脏的。

16:00.709 --> 16:02.044
Clean.
干净的。

16:02.127 --> 16:04.004
Uh, excuse us, but we have
a battle to reenact.
呃，对不起，但是我们有
一场重演的战斗。

16:04.088 --> 16:05.547
Fine.
美好的。

16:05.631 --> 16:07.966
If that's how it is, then
I am joining the other side.
如果是这样的话，那么
我加入了另一边。

16:09.468 --> 16:10.636
Fine, me too.
好吧，我也是。

16:10.719 --> 16:11.887
Oh, come on.
哦，来吧。

16:11.970 --> 16:12.513
Let's go play somewhere else.
我们去别的地方玩吧。

16:17.059 --> 16:19.478
Hah, got your nose.
哈哈，鼻子被摸到了

16:19.561 --> 16:20.979
Hey, give it back.
嘿，还给我吧。

16:21.063 --> 16:22.981
Not until you wash your hands.
直到你洗手为止。

16:23.065 --> 16:24.108
Oh yeah?
哦，是吗？

16:24.191 --> 16:26.985
Well, I got your eyeballs.
好吧，我抓住了你的眼球。

16:28.529 --> 16:29.071
Huh?
啊？

16:38.706 --> 16:40.165
Whoa.
哇哦。

16:40.249 --> 16:41.792
Ew, brain juice.
呃，脑汁。

16:41.875 --> 16:44.336
Do you give up yet?
你还放弃吗？

16:44.420 --> 16:46.880
Sorry, Patrick,
but a filthy slob like you
对不起，帕特里克，
但像你这样的肮脏邋遢的人

16:46.964 --> 16:49.967
is no match for
a clean-cut fellow like me.
不匹配
像我这样干净利落的人。

16:50.050 --> 16:51.677
Your pants are falling down.
你的裤子快掉下来了

16:51.760 --> 16:52.636
Really?
真的吗？

16:52.720 --> 16:53.053
I'll fix it.
我会解决它。

16:59.143 --> 17:00.894
Satisfied?
使满意？

17:00.978 --> 17:02.396
There, you look good now.
在那里，你现在看起来很好。

17:02.479 --> 17:03.939
You could use
a makeover, though.
你可以使用
不过，是一次改头换面。

17:04.022 --> 17:05.190
Ugh, look at those feet.
呃，看看那双脚。

17:05.274 --> 17:06.817
Why, what's wrong with them?
为什么，他们怎么了？

17:06.900 --> 17:07.985
Don't worry.
不用担心。

17:08.068 --> 17:09.153
I'll take care of it.
我会处理的。

17:13.157 --> 17:16.076
No, not a pedicure.
不，不是修脚。

17:17.286 --> 17:19.038
No, no, not that.
不，不，不是那样。

17:19.121 --> 17:20.539
Anything but that.
除了那个之外什么都可以。

17:20.622 --> 17:21.582
Not nail polish.
不是指甲油。

17:26.128 --> 17:27.838
You sick little monster.
你这个病态的小怪物。

17:27.921 --> 17:29.465
Face my morning breath.
面对我早晨的呼吸。

17:38.432 --> 17:40.768
You, sir, could use
some dental hygiene?
先生，您可以使用
一些牙齿卫生？

17:40.851 --> 17:41.977
Who, me?
谁，我？

17:42.060 --> 17:45.397
My teeth are fine, see?
我的牙齿很好，看到了吗？

17:45.481 --> 17:49.067
A little toothpaste,
and you'll have teeth like mine.
牙膏少许，
你将会拥有像我一样的牙齿。

17:55.365 --> 17:59.119
You got to brush
in little circles.
你得刷
在小圈子里。

18:03.707 --> 18:05.417
Minty fresh.
薄荷味清新。

18:05.501 --> 18:08.253
Taste pit, evil-doer.
尝坑，恶人。

18:12.257 --> 18:17.888
You're a stinky,
stinky sea star.
你就是个臭臭的
臭海星。

18:17.971 --> 18:19.932
I think you could use
a shot of this.
我想你可以使用
一个镜头。

18:20.015 --> 18:23.852
No, no, not, not deodorant.
不，不，不，不是除臭剂。

18:31.527 --> 18:35.155
My beautiful pit-stink.
我美丽的坑臭。

18:35.239 --> 18:36.323
It's gone.
它消失了。

18:36.406 --> 18:39.159
The gloves are off now.
现在手套已经脱掉了。

18:39.243 --> 18:40.828
It's booger time.
鼻屎时间到了。

18:40.911 --> 18:42.162
Oh, booger "shmooger."
哦，鼻屎“shmooger”。

18:42.246 --> 18:44.206
You don't even have a nose.
你连鼻子都没有。

18:44.289 --> 18:45.582
Oh yeah?
哦，是吗？

18:53.215 --> 18:54.174
Booger!
鼻屎！

18:58.720 --> 18:59.930
Run!
跑步！

19:00.013 --> 19:01.181
Run, Mr. Krabs.
快跑吧，蟹老板。

19:01.265 --> 19:03.016
Patrick is digging for gold.
帕特里克正在挖金子。

19:05.018 --> 19:06.228
Gold?
金子？

19:11.066 --> 19:13.235
Did you get any
of Patrick's gold?
你收到了吗
帕特里克的黄金？

19:13.318 --> 19:15.946
He's not digging for
any gold I'm looking for.
他不是在挖掘
我正在寻找的任何黄金。

19:16.029 --> 19:17.072
Ah-ha.
啊哈。

19:17.155 --> 19:18.407
I've got you now.
我现在已经得到你了。

19:21.743 --> 19:22.786
Careful, Patrick.
小心，帕特里克。

19:22.870 --> 19:23.829
I've got a weapon.
我有武器。

19:25.289 --> 19:28.166
Ugh, raw onions.
呃，生洋葱。

19:31.378 --> 19:32.796
That does it.
就可以了。

19:32.880 --> 19:34.006
See this?
看到这个了吗？

19:34.089 --> 19:35.507
A Krabby Patty?
蟹肉饼？

19:35.591 --> 19:37.009
What are you gonna do, eat it?
吃掉你要做什么？

19:37.092 --> 19:40.470
Oh, I'm not going to eat it.
哦，我不会吃它。

19:43.432 --> 19:46.935
No, not patty socks.
不，不是小袜子。

19:47.019 --> 19:52.524
That's right, your precious
patties on my stinky feet.
没错，你的宝贝
我的臭脚上有肉饼。

19:52.608 --> 19:54.026
You better stop that.
你最好停止这种行为。

19:56.278 --> 19:57.946
Stinky, little feet.
臭臭的，小脚。

19:58.030 --> 20:01.450
Ooh, you stop that right now.
哦，你现在就停下来。

20:05.621 --> 20:06.538
Hopping...
跳跃...

20:06.622 --> 20:10.125
...crabs.
...螃蟹。

20:11.668 --> 20:15.213
Hey, I got my filth back.
嘿，我把我的脏东西拿回来了。

20:15.297 --> 20:17.674
Not for long, Mr. Stinky Shorts.
不会太久，臭短裤先生。

20:17.758 --> 20:19.968
You won't have your filth
once I use this on you.
你不会有你的污秽
一旦我对你使用这个。

20:24.264 --> 20:26.433
No, not soap.
不，不是肥皂。

20:26.516 --> 20:27.643
You wouldn't dare.
你不敢。

20:27.726 --> 20:29.144
Try me.
试试我吧。

20:29.227 --> 20:31.104
Stay back.
退后一步。

20:31.188 --> 20:32.314
I'll do it.
我会做的。

20:32.397 --> 20:34.733
It's too late for that.
已经太晚了。

20:44.326 --> 20:47.287
My beautiful filth.
我美丽的污秽。

20:47.371 --> 20:48.413
It's gone.
它消失了。

20:48.497 --> 20:51.291
I'm squeaky clean.
我很干净。

20:53.168 --> 20:55.837
I'm covered in muck and scum.
我浑身都是淤泥和浮渣。

20:55.921 --> 21:00.717
Man, to get my filth back,
I'll have to wallow
in mud forever.
伙计，为了拿回我的污秽，
我将不得不沉迷
永远在泥里。

21:00.801 --> 21:03.428
It'll take weeks
for me to get clean.
这需要几周的时间
让我变得干净。

21:03.512 --> 21:05.305
I'll need 20 baths a day.
我每天需要洗20次澡。

21:05.389 --> 21:07.933
Slather toe jam on my armpits.
在我的腋窝上涂抹厚厚的脚趾果酱。

21:08.016 --> 21:10.269
I'll have to disinfect
my eyeballs.
我得消毒
我的眼球。

21:10.352 --> 21:12.479
Smear slime on my teeth.
把粘液涂在我的牙齿上。

21:12.562 --> 21:14.690
And dry clean my uvula.
并干洗我的悬雍垂。

21:18.276 --> 21:20.070
All right!
好的！

21:20.153 --> 21:23.865
Now that I'm filthy, I can spend
all day getting clean.
现在我脏了，我可以花
一整天都变得干净起来。

21:23.949 --> 21:27.369
And since I'm clean,
I can get even filthier.
而且因为我很干净，
我还可以变得更肮脏。

21:27.452 --> 21:28.620
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

21:28.704 --> 21:31.206
No, Patrick, thank you.
不，帕特里克，谢谢你。

21:31.289 --> 21:33.834
You're my best friend ever.
你是我最好的朋友。

21:33.917 --> 21:35.711
Man: Hey, what's going on here?
男：嘿，这是怎么回事？

21:35.794 --> 21:37.879
This battle isn't over
until we have a winner.
这场战斗还没有结束
直到我们分出胜负。

21:37.963 --> 21:41.133
Fret not, my friend,
for I have learned the truth.
别担心，我的朋友，
因为我已经了解了真相。

21:41.216 --> 21:44.761
It matters not whether
one is dirty or clean
是否重要并不重要
一个是脏的还是干净的

21:44.845 --> 21:48.140
for can cleanliness exist
without filthiness?
清洁度是否存在
没有肮脏？

21:48.223 --> 21:51.476
And would we know filthiness
without cleanliness?
我们会知道肮脏吗
没有清洁度？

21:51.560 --> 21:55.981
We must not reenact
the history that divides us.
我们绝不能重蹈覆辙
分裂我们的历史。

21:56.064 --> 22:00.652
Rather, we must embrace
that which draws us together.
相反，我们必须拥抱
使我们走到一起的东西。

22:00.736 --> 22:04.239
All must be free
to choose their own path.
一切必须免费
选择自己的道路。

22:04.322 --> 22:05.365
Right, friend Patrick?
对吧，帕特里克朋友？

22:05.449 --> 22:08.076
Squeaky clean.
干干净净。

22:08.160 --> 22:09.786
Squeaky, it's squeaky.
吱吱作响，真是吱吱作响。

22:09.870 --> 22:10.704
Mm-hm.
嗯嗯。

22:10.787 --> 22:11.830
He has embraced the truth.
他已经接受了真理。

22:11.913 --> 22:13.331
Wow.
哇。

22:13.415 --> 22:16.334
I think the little yellow guy
has taught us a valuable lesson.
我觉得小黄人
给我们上了宝贵的一课。

22:16.418 --> 22:17.919
And what is that, my son?
那是什么，我的儿子？

22:18.003 --> 22:21.006
That reenacting battles
is really lame.
那些重演的战斗
真是蹩脚。

22:21.089 --> 22:22.674
Come on, guys.
来吧，伙计们。

22:22.758 --> 22:25.135
Let's play something more manly,
like football.
玩点更有男人味的吧
就像足球一样。

22:25.218 --> 22:26.344
Or hockey.
或者曲棍球。

22:26.428 --> 22:28.013
Or knitting fluffy sweaters.
或者编织蓬松的毛衣。

22:28.096 --> 22:30.515
Yeah!
是的！

22:30.599 --> 22:32.267
Come, Patrick.
来吧，帕特里克。

22:32.350 --> 22:33.977
My work here is done.
我这里的工作已经完成了。

我这里的工作已经完成了。